# Finding Frank in the Guild's cells (Milestone 20d, escape start).
# Plays on stepping onto the rune in front of his cell.

face player up
emote frank !
say Frank: Oh, thank the Light - somebody's awake! You there, the quiet one. Get me out of here?
narrate The lock is cheap Guild work. Two twists of a thin blade, and it clicks open.
face frank down
say Frank: Frank. Just Frank. A traveling merchant - or I was, before they dragged me in here with the rest of their... collection.
emote player ?
say Frank: The way out is past the counting room, and the enforcer they keep there fights dirty. Poison on the knuckles, a blade where you aren't looking.
say Frank: Keep an antidote handy. And when it cracks its knuckles and grins at you, get your guard up - fast.
set met_frank
narrate Frank falls in behind you.
despawn frank
